#10;Escala logarítmica (asinh) só para exibição, para comparar valores de ordens de grandeza diferentes: o eixo e este texto mostram valores originais; o tracejado marca a mediana dos meses (1,99%).&#10;Classe/série: Subclasse Subordinada Subordinada 1 | (a de mais meses publicados).&#10;Gráfico winsorizado a 2,5% de cada lado: meses abaixo de P2,5 (-6,71%) ou acima de P97,5 (5,27%) aparecem nesses limites (2 meses); a média e o desvio usam os valores publicados (de -7,10% a 8,15%).&#10;Campo CVM TAB_X_VL_RENTAB_MES (tabela inf_mensal_fidc_tab_X_3), publicado em %.\">     <div class=\"tm-rdm-title\">Rentabilidade mensal</div>     <svg class=\"tm-rd-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 62\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Média 0,95% ao mês · desvio-padrão 3,29 p.p. · 29 meses (mai/2024 a set/2026) · último mês -5,11%\"><line class=\"tm-rd-axis\" x1=\"4\" x2=\"216\" y1=\"46\" y2=\"46\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"4.6\" y=\"32.2\" width=\"34.1\" height=\"13.8\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"75.3\" y=\"43.2\" width=\"34.1\" height=\"2.8\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"110.6\" y=\"43.2\" width=\"34.1\" height=\"2.8\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"145.9\" y=\"13.0\" width=\"34.1\" height=\"33.0\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"181.3\" y=\"18.5\" width=\"34.1\" height=\"27.5\" rx=\"1.5\"/><path class=\"tm-rd-curve\" d=\"M4.0,44.5 L7.6,44.3 L11.2,44.1 L14.8,43.8 L18.4,43.6 L22.0,43.3 L25.6,43.0 L29.2,42.7 L32.7,42.3 L36.3,42.0 L39.9,41.6 L43.5,41.2 L47.1,40.7 L50.7,40.3 L54.3,39.8 L57.9,39.3 L61.5,38.8 L65.1,38.3 L68.7,37.7 L72.3,37.2 L75.9,36.6 L79.5,36.0 L83.1,35.5 L86.6,34.9 L90.2,34.3 L93.8,33.8 L97.4,33.2 L101.0,32.7 L104.6,32.2 L108.2,31.7 L111.8,31.2 L115.4,30.8 L119.0,30.4 L122.6,30.0 L126.2,29.7 L129.8,29.5 L133.4,29.2 L136.9,29.1 L140.5,28.9 L144.1,28.8 L147.7,28.8 L151.3,28.8 L154.9,28.9 L158.5,29.1 L162.1,29.2 L165.7,29.5 L169.3,29.7 L172.9,30.0 L176.5,30.4 L180.1,30.8 L183.7,31.2 L187.3,31.7 L190.8,32.2 L194.4,32.7